              "text": "el tranvía — \"the tram, the streetcar\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "El tranvía pasa cada diez minutos. The tram comes every ten minutes."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It ends in -a but is masculine: el tranvía."
            }
          ]
        },
