              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "el bonobús — \"the bus pass (for several trips)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Con el bonobús el viaje sale más barato. With a bus pass the trip works out cheaper."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A Spain word; it holds ten trips, or a month of travel."
            }
          ]
        },
